Bangley.

273
00:31:40,083 --> 00:31:42,375
Aquí. Agáchate.

274
00:31:44,917 --> 00:31:45,917
Quieto.

275
00:31:47,583 --> 00:31:48,667
Bangley.

276
00:31:49,708 --> 00:31:50,708
Quieto.

277
